    {
      "id": "qgqkdm8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Nutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Nutrition encompasses essential biological steps to process nutrients required for growth and survival.",
        "Macronutrients including Carbohydrates, Proteins, and Fats provide energy and cellular structures.",
        "Micronutrients such as Vitamins and Minerals perform critical regulatory and protective metabolic functions.",
        "A Balanced Diet supplies all necessary nutrients in correct proportions to maintain optimal health.",
        "Malnutrition leads to specific nutrition disorders and health complications."
      ],
      "id": "p4625ny"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2firyv5",
      "content": "• Nutrition is the process of obtaining food and utilizing it for energy and body functions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "v74qsuw",
      "content": "• It includes ingestion, digestion, absorption, assimilation and excretion."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "basijig",
      "content": "• Good nutrition helps maintain physical and mental health."
    },
    {
      "id": "8x3opcq",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Steps in Nutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uehusrb",
      "content": "• Ingestion – Taking food into the body."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tin8cap",
      "content": "• Digestion – Breaking down complex food into simple molecules."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2pxekbw",
      "content": "• Absorption – Nutrients enter the bloodstream through the intestine."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "09jjp9m",
      "content": "• Assimilation – Nutrients used by cells for energy and growth."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3lb3meo",
      "content": "• Egestion – Removal of undigested waste."
    },
    {
